<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Order Confirmation</title>

    <style>
        /* Base Reset */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #F9FAFB;
            padding: 50px 15px;
            color: #1F2937;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }

        /* Professional Clean Header */
        .header {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 40px 40px 20px 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #4F46E5;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #374151;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* Modernized Itemized List Style instead of heavy cards */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: #6B7280;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-left: 4px;
        }

        .info-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            background: #F9FAFB;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
        }

        .info-table td {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .info-table tr:not(:last-child) td {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
        }

        .label {
            color: #6B7280;
            font-weight: 500;
            width: 35%;
        }

        .value {
            color: #111827;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .value.highlight {
            color: #4F46E5;
        }

        /* Premium Pricing Section */
        .price-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 0 4px;
        }

        .price-table td {
            padding: 10px 0;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .price-table .price-label {
            color: #4B5563;
        }

        .price-table .price-value {
            text-align: right;
            color: #111827;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .price-table tr.total-row td {
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #E5E7EB;
        }

        .price-table .total-label {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .price-table .total-value {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #4F46E5;
            text-align: right;
        }

        /* Premium CTA Button */
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4F46E5;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        /* Support block */
        .support-card {
            background: #EEF2F6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            color: #4B5563;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .support-card strong {
            color: #1F2937;
        }

        /* Footer Accent */
        .footer {
            background: #F9FAFB;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 40px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #9CA3AF;
            line-height: 1.8;
            border-top: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
        }

        .footer strong {
            color: #4B5563;
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 15px 5px;
            }
            .header, .content, .footer {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            .info-table td {
                padding: 14px 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="wrapper">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="brand-logo">YOUR LMS PLATFORM</div>
            <h1>Thank you for your order.</h1>
        </div>
/
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content">
            
            <p class="greeting">
                Hello,<br><br>
                We're excited to confirm your enrollment! Your payment has cleared successfully, and your course is unlocked. You can jump directly into the materials below.
            </p>

            <!-- Course Info Group -->
            <div class="section-title">Registration Details</div>
            <table class="info-table">
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Order ID</td>
                    <td class="value">#<%= order._id %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Date</td>
                    <td class="value"><%= order.date %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Course Title</td>
                    <td class="value highlight"><%= order.name %></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Pricing breakdown -->
            <div class="section-title">Receipt Summary</div>
            <table class="price-table">
                <tr>
                    <td class="price-label">Subtotal</td>
                    <td class="price-value">$<%= order.price %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="price-label">Discounts</td>
                    <td class="price-value">$0.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="total-row">
                    <td class="total-label">Total Charged</td>
                    <td class="total-value">$<%= order.price %></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- CTA -->
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="" class="button">
                    Go to Dashboard &rarr;
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Contextual Help -->
            <div class="support-card">
                <strong>Have any questions?</strong><br>
                If you encounter any difficulty accessing your curriculum or managing your invoice details, please reply directly to this mail. Our academic success desk is ready to help.
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <strong>Grow your skills every day.</strong>
            <br>
            You are receiving this automated invoice because a purchase was made under your account email addresses.
            <br><br>
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Your LMS Company Inc. All Rights Reserved.
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>